# Non-secret template for the staging server environment.
#
# The only credential staging needs is its OWN JWT_SECRET (distinct from the
# production secret), generated on the host at install time and written to
# /root/pyxis-STAGING-5274/server/.env (root, mode 600). See README.md — the
# .env write requires the owner's file-specific approval.
#
# No MONGODB_URI, no STRIPE_*, no NVIDIA_* folding keys, no EMAIL_* keys are
# used or wanted: demo mode keeps folding fixture-only, refuses billing/email/
# ADMET, and answers unknown /api paths with 503. Simulation catalog browsing
# and search proxy the read-only ASINEX catalog; docking/DiffDock forward to
# the real providers only when the service URLs below are set (owner-authorized
# for the synthetic demo account — those calls cost money). Nothing here is
# secret; do not commit real secrets anywhere.

# --- required ---
# JWT_SECRET: generated on host, >= 32 chars, distinct from production.
#   openssl rand -base64 48

# --- fixed by the systemd unit (deploy/staging/pyxis-web-staging.service) ---
# PYXIS_DEMO_MODE=true
# PORT=5274
# BIND_HOST=127.0.0.1
# FRONTEND_DIST=/root/pyxis-STAGING-5274/client/dist
# NODE_ENV=production

# --- optional: real Simulation services on staging (owner-authorized) ---------
# Supplier catalog routes are retired regardless of ASINEX_API_BASE or company
# overrides. Scientific URLs must point to qualified Pyxis services: known
# Asinex defaults return503 locally without charging. Historical env variable
# names remain compatible; they do not imply permission to use the supplier.
# ASINEX_DOCKING_API_URL=https://<approved-pyxis-compute>/docking
# DIFFDOCK_API_URL=https://<approved-pyxis-compute>/molecular-docking/diffdock/generate
# SDF_CONVERTER_URL=https://<approved-pyxis-compute>/convertSTR

# --- macrocycle search preview (non-secret systemd drop-in) -------------------
# deploy/staging/10-macrocycle-search.conf sets MACROCYCLE_SEARCH_BASE to the
# separate loopback-only compact index service on :8274. Do not add this to
# server/.env: the staging .env contains JWT_SECRET and is not part of deploys.
# Real and virtual sources are distinct named datasets. Stock uses its separately
# configured STOCK_SEARCH_BASE and dataset selection; measure availability.

# --- optional, for local/off-host runs only ---
# PYXIS_DEMO_MODE=true
# JWT_SECRET=replace-with-at-least-32-chars
# PORT=5274
# BIND_HOST=127.0.0.1
# FRONTEND_DIST=../client/dist   # when using the STAGING-built client/dist
